{"assets":["/statement-assets/785ad57042e20e84c58566bca22c19fcb5fb31c6b8bab622061b41e6b02160d4.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1108","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Two distinct points"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two segments $$$[l_1; r_1]$$$ and $$$[l_2; r_2]$$$ on the $$$x$$$-axis. It is guaranteed that $$$l_1 \\lt r_1$$$ and $$$l_2 \\lt r_2$$$. Segments "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"may intersect, overlap or even coincide with each other"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/785ad57042e20e84c58566bca22c19fcb5fb31c6b8bab622061b41e6b02160d4.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The example of two segments on the $$$x$$$-axis."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your problem is to find two "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"integers"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ such that $$$l_1 \\le a \\le r_1$$$, $$$l_2 \\le b \\le r_2$$$ and $$$a \\ne b$$$. In other words, you have to choose two "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer points in such a way that the first point belongs to the segment $$$[l_1; r_1]$$$ and the second one belongs to the segment $$$[l_2; r_2]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the answer exists"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". If there are multiple answers, you can print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$q$$$ independent queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 500$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$q$$$ lines contains four integers $$$l_{1_i}, r_{1_i}, l_{2_i}$$$ and $$$r_{2_i}$$$ ($$$1 \\le l_{1_i}, r_{1_i}, l_{2_i}, r_{2_i} \\le 10^9, l_{1_i} \\lt r_{1_i}, l_{2_i} \\lt r_{2_i}$$$) — the ends of the segments in the $$$i$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$2q$$$ integers. For the $$$i$$$-th query print two integers $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$ — such numbers that $$$l_{1_i} \\le a_i \\le r_{1_i}$$$, $$$l_{2_i} \\le b_i \\le r_{2_i}$$$ and $$$a_i \\ne b_i$$$. Queries are numbered in order of the input."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the answer exists"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". If there are multiple answers, you can print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2 1 2\n2 6 3 4\n2 4 1 3\n1 2 1 3\n1 4 5 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 1\n3 4\n3 2\n1 2\n3 7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1108A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1108/problem/A"}